abstract: "Software and retained results for separate CSP–CNN, EEGNet, Lee2019 confidence and SHU architecture/output evaluations. Repeated fits are averaged within people and different study designs are not pooled. The completed 270-fit W4 mechanism control is accompanied by an independent audit and paired retained-result verification as a separate exploratory analysis. LICENSING.md defines MIT software, author-owned CC BY 4.0 materials and unchanged upstream data terms."
